  "title": "Banana Prune Muffins",
  "description": "They are so delicious - you wouldn't believe that something with prunes would be so good, but they are! And they are low in fat - 1 muffin is less than 5grams of fat. They are so moist and not rubbery or chewy! A definite must try. I had the whole lot devoured in a day.",
  "authors": [
    "LISA BRETON"
